# Build context for deploy/docker/* (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The workspace sources, web UIs, packaging and deploy files go in; build output,
# the Python 0.5 tree and VCS data stay out. dist/docker is the prebuilt-binary
# layout written by `cargo run -p xtask -- docker-context`.
**/target
.git
.github
.venv
.ocr-env*
.playwright-mcp
**/__pycache__
*.db
src
tests
tools
docs
dist/*
!dist/docker
